  "Every clock in the world lost exactly one second on the same day, and the official explanation was 'rounding error.'",
  "The most terrifying thing about the universe isn't that it's hostile — it's that it's indifferent, which leaves us free to embarrass ourselves.",

  // Everyday absurd (35)
  "I wasn't sure what was more alarming — that my plants were dying, or that they seemed to be doing it in an organized pattern.",
