  // Humor/sarcasm (35)
  "'I'm not saying it's aliens,' she said, 'but I'm also not not saying it's aliens.'",
  "'Well, that went better than expected,' she said, standing in the smoldering ruins of what had been a very expensive laboratory.",
  "'I have a plan,' he announced, and everyone in the room who knew him immediately started updating their resumes.",
  "'Technically, it's not a lie if I believed it when I said it and only later realized I was wrong,' she explained.",
  "'I've made a terrible mistake,' he said, 'and I need your help — also your car, your savings, and your complete lack of judgment.'",
  "'On a scale of one to ten, how bad is it?' she asked, and he said 'pi,' which was somehow the most terrifying possible answer.",
  "'This is either going to work brilliantly or fail catastrophically,' she said, 'and either way, it's going to be hilarious.'",
