  "'I'm not procrastinating,' I explained, 'I'm allowing my ideas to marinate in the rich broth of my anxiety.'",
  "'We need to talk,' she said, and my soul briefly left my body to go live a simpler life as a houseplant.",
  "'I've been called worse,' he shrugged, 'probably in the last five minutes, if I'm being honest.'",
  "'The presentation is tomorrow? I thought it was next month,' I said, in a voice that was totally calm and not at all screaming internally.",
  "'Define 'disaster,'' she requested, and he pulled out a PowerPoint presentation with forty-seven slides.",
