  "'To be fair,' he said, in a situation where fairness was the last thing anyone was thinking about.",
  "'I told you so,' she whispered, with the restraint of someone who had been waiting seven years to say those exact words.",
  "'That's a terrible idea,' he said, 'count me in.'",

